## Academic Work

**2024 — Master's Thesis in Epistemology, Strasbourg University**

*On the Notion of the Large-Scale Structure of the Universe*  
[HAL repository](https://hal.science/hal-04819746)

Historical and conceptual investigation of the notion of large-scale structure in cosmology. Combining historical epistemology with interviews with scientists, this work examines the evolution of the concepts and theoretical frameworks used to describe the cosmic web, filaments and galactic environments, as well as the ways in which these structures are represented and understood in astrophysics.

