## Research Supervision

**2026 — Brieuc Erre**, MSc Epistemology student, ObAS

*Robustness and objectivity: how do astrophysicists evaluate the validity of their results?*

10-day research project exploring the epistemological status of scientific results in astrophysics, particularly the criteria and practices through which researchers establish the validity, robustness and objectivity of their findings when dealing with objects that cannot be directly manipulated or experimentally reproduced.

